        content: 'Compare the card\'s annual fee against the real rupee value of the points and perks you reliably use each year:\n\n- **Card Annual Fee:** ₹3,000 + GST (₹3,540)\n- **Annual Spends:** ₹4,00,000 (Earns 16,000 Points)\n- **True Rupee Value (at ₹0.50/pt):** ₹8,000\n- **Lounge Access / Milestone Benefits:** ₹2,000\n- **Total Annual Value:** ₹10,000\n- **Net Annual Profit:** +₹6,460 (Card is worth keeping)\n\nIf net annual profit is negative, downgrade to a lifetime-free or flat cashback card.'
