    summary: 'Planning early retirement in India? Learn why the US 4% rule fails, how healthcare inflation erodes wealth, and how to calculate a resilient Indian FIRE number.',
    tags: ['FIRE', 'Early Retirement', 'Retirement Planning', 'Inflation', 'Safe Withdrawal Rate'],
